---
const { title = 'SETOUCHI ATLAS', description = '地形・気候・海況から、生業・産業・港・文化・都市形成までを因果で読む。' } = Astro.props;
const baseUrl = '/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/';
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href={baseUrl}>SETOUCHI ATLAS</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/">TOP</a>
        <a href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/book/">エッセイ</a>
        <a href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/places/">地域</a>
        <a href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/chapters/">研究ノート</a>
        <a href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/comparative-reading/">比較</a>
        <a href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/#data-library">データ</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main><slot /></main>
    <footer id="about">
      <strong>SETOUCHI ATLAS</strong>
      <p>自然環境が何を可能にし、人間がそれを何に変え、地域間の流れと時間がどう組み替えたのか。事実・解釈・仮説を分けながら、瀬戸内の地域形成を因果で読む。</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
